      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Collagen vascular disease is among the least understood entities in medicine. What appears to be a localized process may be a manifestation of a systemic disease with serious sequelae. The otolaryngologist must be aware of the manifestations of these disorders in the head and neck."},
